    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just feeling like an outsider. it's the feeling that my time is just... done. like the season has changed and i'm the only thing left from the one before. everything i used to value, everyone i used to know, it just doesn't exist in this new world. it would be so much easier if i could just stop trying to keep up. to just stop being a burden to a world that doesn't even see me.",
